<title>USA: CNB Financial doubles authorized shares.</title>
<headline>CNB Financial doubles authorized shares.</headline>
<dateline>CANAJOHARIE, N.Y.</dateline>
<text>
<p>CNB Financial Corp on Thursday said stockholders voted to increase the number of its authorized shares to 10 million from 5 million.</p>
<p>CNB said it has no current plans to issue the additional shares.</p>
</text>
